{"title":"2024 IOQM/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Case_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Case 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Case_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Case 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Case_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Case 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many 3­ digit numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d6cf4e9d072fbeba4fb13dffe63fa9ca820854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{abc}$\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> in base 10 are there with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93542ba7ddfa6e5d5aa9ec642446b0c8fea7efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe1cdc1e46873ba2ac448fb547e5af2c278b0286.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/b/23bba41fc3b5fad33bab5d3990a61fe0be7a34c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\ne0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are all base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digits with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/4/2844bbe4e08e7e609f81ad97cb2cf75faae34b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, then we would have some cases:\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Case_1\">Case 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Case 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/2/6227e0c2730af45a4f1b7e2ea8d50340b12fb5c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/b/23bba41fc3b5fad33bab5d3990a61fe0be7a34c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\ne0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" />, our only possibility is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca92a1ddfa5e8c326ade17a9ebb0c71fa487d1b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> case.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Case_2\">Case 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Case 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f72da4187cb0ff8d0471bef17474df62fe69c94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/7/52767a15206e4ef992fc30ca6aa36fdd4dc0f0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, so our possibilities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c8676b700ac5df8ef3bf1eb43981ce64afc11464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7a465ffe5255961382f5777569608be052b783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cases.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Case_3\">Case 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_IOQM/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Case 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/8271d4342b38d2ab38bb626ffad8b9dae00b5e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9b7652b7b0529cb87c5e97e883376f331b43cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, so our possibilities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b6476004d6e4ea2a1308a1cf58867818f3ba6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(3,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/6/aa6bb1c456d71ee24e7a0ee603d226a7992e5da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb913ad463dcc2916d4135977f0d06f20ad93cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cases.\n</p><p>We can now start to see a pattern that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/167f581ab31e2f3b52940e56c5941d86120f1458.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"10\" />, then there will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> cases (you can check if this pattern works by keep listing cases, by I won't do it here), so our answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/6/5763b1503f0db36fd3733977e81d4aebe5305c19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+4+5+6+7+8+9=\\boxed{45}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"315\" height=\"25\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digit (which means it has maximum value 9). \n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> cannot equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065858\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5720/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36157:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065858 and revision id 280586. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}